{"availability":"available","full":"AHMADMALIK1376/FocusFlow","name":"FocusFlow","description":"A productivity suite built using React that emphasizes regular management and deep work. Concave navigation cuts, glassmorphism, and a flexible sliding authentication mechanism are just a few of the sophisticated CSS techniques used in this project. Constructed with custom CSS modules, Context API, and React","category":"Design","language":"JavaScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-02-27T09:26:58Z","updated":"2026-10-11T08:25:48Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://focus-flow-two-pi.vercel.app","topics":[],"demo":"https://focus-flow-two-pi.vercel.app/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T11:05:46.180Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-11T11:05:46.180Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-11T11:05:46.180Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-11T11:05:46.180Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A study companion for students that keeps your subjects, classes, exams, grades and reminders in one place.","Scan your timetable or date sheet, and FocusFlow tells you when your next class is, which exam is coming up, what your GPA looks like, and whether you've handed in that assignment.","FocusFlow started as a general productivity app and has been rebuilt around students at school, college and university. Everything is organised around your subjects. A subject ties together its class times, attendance, grades, exams, assignments, notes and flashcards."],"features":["Screenshot scanner. Take a screenshot of your university portal's timetable, date sheet, marks or assignments list. FocusFlow reads it in the browser with OCR, shows every row on an editable review screen, and then…","Reminders by phone pop-up (web push), email, and optionally WhatsApp: classes, exams, deadlines, routine items, a morning digest, plus follow-up questions like \"Did you attend?\", \"Did you submit?\" and \"How did the quiz…","Sign in with email and password (with email verification and password reset codes) or with Google.","Onboarding for new accounts.","26 languages to choose from in Settings, with full translations for English, Spanish, French, German, Portuguese, Arabic, Chinese, Hindi and Urdu. The others fall back to English. Right-to-left layout works for Arabic,…"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/AHMADMALIK1376/FocusFlow/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"e1965cb435c8c4adea26e63f86070c12ecc9be7abb019af39fa26061d4412a97","extractedAt":"2026-10-11T11:05:46.367Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T11:05:46.367Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A study companion for students that keeps your subjects, classes, exams, grades and reminders in one place.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/AHMADMALIK1376/FocusFlow/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Sign in with email and password (with email verification and password reset codes) or with Google.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/AHMADMALIK1376/FocusFlow/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Your colours also show on the sign-in pages (this browser remembers the last student's colours), error and offline pages, charts, sign-in illustrations, reminder emails and the answer pages opened from reminder links.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/AHMADMALIK1376/FocusFlow/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"e1965cb435c8c4adea26e63f86070c12ecc9be7abb019af39fa26061d4412a97","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/AHMADMALIK1376/FocusFlow/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-11T11:05:46.367Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-11T08:25:48Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/AHMADMALIK1376/FocusFlow/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-11T11:05:46.369Z","hash":"e1965cb435c8c4adea26e63f86070c12ecc9be7abb019af39fa26061d4412a97","originalBytes":30380,"storedBytes":30380,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["api","backe